      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 48,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "保留原话，",
        "也继续思考。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9a20d81389ce",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 302,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 18,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29.7,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "记录过去，并不意味着把现在凝固。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-f864ef4d1cbb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 376,
      "width": null,
