    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 726,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "你可能刚认出一个旧想法，就想改进它的表",
        "达：句子太长，某个约束已经不再适用，粗",
        "略的问题值得写得更清楚。让档案有用，就",
        "要允许这样的工作，而不是把每个保存下来",
        "的字都视为不可触碰。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-60638d5b24f6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 902,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "与此同时，过去不应该被悄悄改写。在比较",
        "思考如何变化时，今天润色过的版本不能冒",
        "充上个月真正写下的内容。一份工作档案，",
        "必须同时满足这两种需要。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dca98617c2a7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1049,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 区分原始来源和可编辑的工作版本。来",
        "源提供回到当时事实的路径，工作版本则让",
        "你把材料整理成现在可读、可用的样子。它",
        "们无需冒充彼此。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8f1e28d061a9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1216,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1216,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1258,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不",
        "是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1461,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "可选的 AI 辅助增加的是一个层次，而不是另",
        "一个主人。更清晰的呈现可能有帮助，但它",
        "必须区别于来源材料和人工修改。自动更新",
        "不应该悄悄丢掉你已经完成的工作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3d84d3d596a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1608,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "到了复用的时候，哪个版本有用，取决于具",
        "体任务。你可能需要原始引文、当前的工作",
        "总结，或几段选中的材料。预览内容是选择",
        "的一部分，而不是把它从档案取出的障碍。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b1ed7845f895",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1755,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "连贯，不意味着永远不改变主意。它意味着",
        "：当时说过的话、此刻的想法、以及下一步",
        "的选择之间，存在一条可以看懂的联系。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-99fc79b62de8",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1899,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-390.022",
